# API keys and AI settings for the Sellout Cleaner. Copy to .env and fill in.
# Easiest: use the "AI connection" box in the app sidebar, which writes this file for you.
# Or fill in the key for the provider you want (free tiers: Gemini, Groq, OpenRouter ':free' models, Mistral, Hugging Face):
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=      https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   GROQ_API_KEY=        https://console.groq.com/keys
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=  https://openrouter.ai/keys
#   MISTRAL_API_KEY=     https://console.mistral.ai/api-keys
#   HF_TOKEN=            https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens  (Hugging Face)
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=   https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=      https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# and pick it: LLM_PROVIDER=gemini | groq | openrouter | mistral | huggingface | ollama | anthropic | openai | custom
LLM_PROVIDER=
